<title>SWITZERLAND: SMH estimates 1996 sales at 2.8 bln Sfr.</title>
<headline>SMH estimates 1996 sales at 2.8 bln Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>BIEL, Switzerland 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss watchmaker Ste Suisse Microelectronique et d'Horlogerie SA (SMH) said 1996 sales rose six percent from the year earlier to 2.8 billion Swiss francs.</p>
<p>An SMH spokesman said the number, contained in an SMH news release about a venture with fashion group  Calvin Klein, Inc, was an estimate.</p>
<p>&quot;This is an estimate,&quot; spokeswoman Beatrice Howald said.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
